                </div>
                <div style="margin-top: 15px; display: flex; gap: 10px;">
                    <button style="padding: 8px 16px; background-color: #1890ff; color: white; border: none; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer;">
                        <i class="fas fa-eye"></i> 查看实时视频
                    </button>
                    <button style="padding: 8px 16px; background-color: #f5f7fa; color: #5e6c82; border: 1px solid #d9d9d9; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer;">
                        <i class="fas fa-cog"></i> 配置设备
