        <div class="main-content" id="mainContent">
            <div class="page-header">
                <div>
                    <div class="page-title">设备要素</div>
                    <div style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #8c8c8c; margin-top: 5px;">自动标注的车道、人行横道、信号灯、摄像头等要素管理</div>
                </div>
